@startuml ARCH-04c-华为云部署课堂简图
' 课堂汇报拆分图，来源：../ARCH-04b-候选部署图-华为云能力映射.puml
!pragma layout smetana
title 华为云部署与能力映射
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

node "用户设备\nAndroid 12+ / Windows 11" as Client #E8F3EF

cloud "华为云" as Huawei #EDE7F6 {
  node "ECS 或 CCE" as Compute {
    component "Ingress" as Ingress
    component "身份与同步" as Sync
    component "AI / RAG 网关" as AI
    component "任务 Worker" as Worker
  }
  database "RDS for PostgreSQL\n当前态、变更流、任务表" as RDS
  component "DEW / KMS\n密钥与凭据" as KMS
  component "LTS + AOM / APM\n内容无关日志、指标、追踪" as Obs
  component "OBS / CSS\n可选扩展能力\n一期不存原文和本地索引" as Optional #F8F9FA
}

cloud "受控模型 API" as Model #FFF3E0

Client --> Ingress : HTTPS 443
Ingress --> Sync
Ingress --> AI
Sync --> RDS
AI --> RDS
Worker --> RDS
KMS ..> Compute : 启动时注入
Compute ..> Obs : 白名单遥测
AI --> Model : HTTPS

note bottom of Huawei
业务合同保持云中立。三个责任单元一期可部署在同一计算节点，
后续依据资源、可用性和隔离证据再拆分。
end note
@enduml
